{"chunk_id": "6e93e614f8ed", "text": "As Rama prepares for his final departure from the world, he first secures the future of his kingdom and lineage. He divides Kosala between his sons, installing Kusha in Kushavati in the Vindhya region and Lava in the famed city of Shravasti, giving them wealth, armies, and loyal subjects. Messengers then bring grave news to Shatrughna: Lakshmana\u2019s banishment, Rama\u2019s vow, and the people\u2019s determination to follow their king into heaven. Realizing the end of their royal house on earth is near, Shatrughna enthrones his own sons and hastens to Ayodhya. There he finds Rama surrounded by sages and celestial beings who have gathered to witness his departure. Allies from across the epic\u2014monkeys, bears, rakshasas, and gods\u2014assemble, while Sugriva declares his intention to follow Rama, marking the beginning of a cosmic farewell to the avatar-king.\nRama finalizes succession, summons Shatrughna, and grants last commands as allies and beings gather to accompany him before his departure.\nThemes: royal succession, loyalty and devotion, renunciation of kingship, approaching divine departure", "vector": [0.02185630612075329, -0.013636783696711063, -0.00479862280189991, -0.008232899010181427, -0.008105827495455742, 0.026323873549699783, -0.03239655867218971, -0.01357659138739109, -0.021976690739393234, 0.005868698935955763, 0.017535872757434845, 0.011831030249595642, 0.0022103760857135057, 0.026818783953785896, -0.009938332252204418, 0.0032236045226454735, 0.044996704906225204, -0.026564640924334526, 0.023969706147909164, -0.013696975074708462, 0.0032269484363496304, -0.021013621240854263, -0.008018883876502514, 0.002028128830716014, -0.00888163223862648, 0.006397049408406019, 0.011623702943325043, -0.032851338386535645, 0.02394295483827591, -0.012881042435765266, -0.005614555906504393, -0.005484140478074551, -0.012265748344361782, -0.017214851453900337, -0.020478583872318268, 0.006861863657832146, 0.007363461889326572, 